Description: Open source cloud storage and file sync server - thumbnail server
 Seafile is a self-hosted file sync and share solution with high performance
 and reliability. It offers file syncing across devices, selective sync,
 client-side and server-side encryption, and team collaboration features.
 .
 This package contains the thumbnail server, which takes over thumbnail
 generation from Seahub and adds thumbnails for more file types. Its Python
 dependencies ship as a bundled virtualenv resolved with uv at build time.
